{"unit_id":"Chhlafiu4312__citeguard#feature-1","repo":"Chhlafiu4312/citeguard","commit":"80cd36ef1afbbf18693d7adbdb8326aaeabac830","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteGuard 的功能「引文提取」：从文本和 Markdown 链接中识别 DOI、arXiv、HTTP URL，并规范化、去重和记录行列位置。可通过 DSH 工具输入草稿，或调用 TypeScript API。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/extractor.ts:217-259","src/tool.ts:45-53"]}
{"unit_id":"Chhlafiu4312__citeguard#feature-2","repo":"Chhlafiu4312/citeguard","commit":"80cd36ef1afbbf18693d7adbdb8326aaeabac830","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CiteGuard 的功能「元数据核验」：在线时按网络配置查询 DOI 的 Crossref 或 arXiv 元数据，检查标题相似度并给出 verified、mismatch 等结果；它不判断来源是否支持论点。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/verifier.ts:107-158","src/verifier.ts:188-205"]}
